  "notes": "Describes the 2026–27 school year: primary grades 1–4, basic secondary 5–9 and a 2-year profile secondary (grades 10–11). Reform under way: Law No. 463-IX (art. 4) sets profile secondary at 3 years, 12 years in all; the 3-year profile school applies to all learners entering it from 1 September 2027, so the first full cohort reaches grade 12 in 2029/30 (earlier in pilot schools by Cabinet decision)."
